title: Foreign Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; foreign_policy_timer += 8
view-if: lwusp_in_government = 1 and foreign_minister_party = "LWUSP" and foreign_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/wisci.jpg
go-to: fp_menu
#subtitle: International relations.

= Foreign Policy

What should our foreign policy priority be?

